## Release History

### Version 0.9.6 (2026-11-28)

Add the AI pure-math spherical matrix loader, the Pro multi-device mockup container, and three Motion FX components.

- **New components**: matrix-loader, device-mockup, distortion-wave, pixel-field, voice-ring
- **Main updated components**: none
- **Key features**:
  - New `TxMatrixLoader` (`@talex-touch/tuffex/ai`): pure-math Canvas 2D spherical halftone loader with 8 AI semantic states, smooth state cross-morphing, 2D gradient noise modulation, and 5 electronic display eras (`oled`, `crt`, `vfd`, `dither`, `lcd`).
  - New `TxDeviceMockup` (`@talex-touch/tuffex/pro`): 75+ tree-shakeable phone, tablet, laptop, desktop, rounded/circular watch, and browser presets with an extruded 3D hardware chassis, decoupled floor shadows, 8 curated Shots.so scene pairings, 7 shadow styles, bleed framing, 12 gradients with film grain, spring morph transitions on device/orientation switch, and lazy client-side SVG/PNG/WebP export.
  - New `TxDistortionWave` (`@talex-touch/tuffex/pro`): transparent WebGL2 chromatic lens wave view transition supporting `vertical`, `horizontal`, and `center` geometry, 5 palettes, sharp `#overlay` controls, `scrub` freezing, Vue `Ref` sources, and reduced-motion crossfade fallback.
  - New `TxVoiceRing` (`@talex-touch/tuffex/pro`): voice-reactive glass spectrum (`ring`) and twin tube (`mono`) audio indicator with emotion tint, spatial `direction` lean with boundary refraction, `hoverBend`, and `useVoiceRingMicrophone`.
  - New `TxPixelField` (`@talex-touch/tuffex/pro`): zero-dependency Canvas 2D interactive square-pixel particle stage with 6 botanical/geometric presets, aspect-preserving `src`/`text` sampling, 5 palettes, `obsidian`/`adaptive` stages, 4 pointer physics modes, click pulses, and `useMotionActivity` gating.

